<text x="2" y="98" size="1.8" layer="21" ratio="12">xPort Pro V.92 Fax Card rev A — 150 x 100 mm, 2 layers, 1.57 mm FR-4 (PCI-class card thickness)</text>
<text x="2" y="95.5" size="1.2" layer="21" ratio="12">SELV only: 12 V in at J1, 3.3 V derived. No mains on this card.</text>
<text x="2" y="20" size="1.2" layer="21" ratio="12">J3 (RJ11) and X1 (xPort Pro RJ45) overhang the bottom edge — that is the EIO faceplate end</text>
<text x="66" y="98" size="1.4" layer="21" ratio="12">PSTN — isolation is inside U3; keep TIP/RING off every pad except U3 and J3</text>
<text x="33" y="24" size="1.2" layer="21" ratio="12">U3 DAA end (+X) — no copper, no test point, keep L1 away</text>
<text x="71" y="12" size="1.2" layer="21" ratio="12">J5 EIO keep-out 68 x 12 mm: no copper until the slot pinout is traced from a donor JetDirect card</text>
<wire x1="0" y1="14" x2="150" y2="14" width="0.4" layer="21" style="shortdash"/>
